soc: qcom: add bootloader and TZ/HYP log readers

From: ynk <evils.ynk@gmail.com>

Expose the bootloader log and Qualcomm hypervisor diagnostic ring buffers (/proc/tzdbg/hyp_log, /proc/tzdbg/hyp_general) on salami.

Signed-off-by: ynk <evils.ynk@gmail.com>
---
