 drivers/firmware/qcom/Makefile    |    1 
 drivers/firmware/qcom/tz_log.c    |  283 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/soc/qcom/Kconfig          |    9 +
 drivers/soc/qcom/Makefile         |    1 
 drivers/soc/qcom/bootloader_log.c |  137 ++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 441 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/firmware/qcom/tz_log.c
